  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "8ee2bd88-b8b7-4abf-a5fd-6e16106ed9ad"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "is the ",
 StyleBox["k", "TI"],
 "-th map of that type in increasing order of size: the ",
 StyleBox["k", "TI"],
 " \[Times] ",
 StyleBox["k", "TI"],
 " flat torus when the type is Euclidean, the ",
 StyleBox["k", "TI"],
 "-th quotient of the triangle group otherwise.",
 "\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"39f0109e-fbaa-4224-ab80-8c1e1d9bd3d9"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
