  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "41e82ced-870d-43f9-9a5b-b5f2ef4cff6d"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "is the map carried by a (2, ",
 StyleBox["p", "TI"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["q", "TI"],
 ")-generation of the finite group ",
 StyleBox["G", "TI"],
 ".",
 "\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"a6862775-7bd8-4dc5-b13d-ecf47c49fe9b"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["TessellationGraph"]], 
