  "46a02ef1-2286-44a7-b020-c2915a7c2dad"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "is the uniform map with vertex configuration ",
 StyleBox["config", "TI"],
 ", the cyclic list of face sizes around a vertex, built on the ",
 StyleBox["k", "TI"],
 "-th map of its parent type."
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"9e34b421-0e05-4e6b-bcd5-f03006edbecb"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A regular map of type {",
 StyleBox["p", "TI"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["q", "TI"],
 "} is a closed surface cut into ",
 StyleBox["p", "TI"],
 "-gons, ",
 StyleBox["q", "TI"],
 " at every vertex, with a rotation taking any directed edge to any other. \
The graph is its 1-skeleton. The faces are not returned."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"d6b45f89-2d25-4391-afc7-785436e2b7b9"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The sign of (",
 StyleBox["p", "TI"],
 " \[Minus] 2)(",
 StyleBox["q", "TI"],
 " \[Minus] 2) \[Minus] 4 is the sign of the curvature. It decides the \
surface:"
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"e15877bf-ea96-40d7-8700-661365cbce91"],

